From 4270622d3e88c72dc82de27ea69453cbe94120d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:14:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Networking is Lua now: one generic socket API in C++
 (openmw.net: connect/listen/send/close + onNetEvent), client, server, JSON
 and the internet-address lookup moved to netlib.lua

C++ drops the client, server and address classes and the JSON encoder (~1100 lines -> ~350).
ui.setPlayerMarkers renamed ui.setMapMarkers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
